# Flags forwarded to the resumed claude. An allowlist, because only a known
# table can tell a flag meant for claude from a misspelling of one of ours;
# anything unlisted is refused with the nearest match named, and a flag
# claude grows is refused until it is added here.
#
# Not derived from `claude --help`: that costs most of a second, and it omits
# --agent-id, --agent-name, --team-name, --parent-session-id and --agent-color,
